<h4 class="boldbyline">
Re: Six Months of Famine
</h4>

<p>
I'm not talking about "spun, fluffy crap." No one wants that.<br />
<br />
And since when is "a good read driven by facts from face-to-face meetings" considered old school?<br />
<br />
Who is The Man?
</p>
